---
import Page from '../components/Page.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---

<Page title="About" description={`What ${SITE.name} is, how the calculators are built, and how to reach us.`}>
  <p>
    {SITE.name} publishes free calculators for home improvement, landscaping, and small construction projects. The goal
    is simple: help you buy the right amount of material the first time, in the units stores and suppliers actually
    sell.
  </p>
  <h2>How the calculators are built</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Every calculator shows the formula it uses and the assumptions behind it, such as bag yields or material density.</li>
    <li>Formulas are covered by automated tests with hand-checked examples, so a change cannot silently break a result.</li>
    <li>Quantities are rounded up to whole bags, boards, or ordering increments, because running short costs more than a little leftover.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Limits</h2>
  <p>
    Results are planning estimates. Local codes, engineered plans, and your supplier's product data always take
    priority. If you spot an error, please <a href="/contact/">tell us</a> and we will fix it.
  </p>
</Page>
